invariant: INV-67
file: mldsa.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mldsa-vector
reason: mldsa.c's forward transform calls mldsa_poly.c's loop in an
  arm64 host object, so every verification runs that transform at the
  loop's speed. Every verdict stays right, because the loop computes the
  same coefficients; only the time is wrong. bin/mldsa_runtime_test
  counts the calls into the lanes that a verification makes under each
  ch_cfg.cpu value, and the script runs it for arm64 under qemu-aarch64.

--- old
static void mld_ntt(mld_poly *p) {
#if MLD_VECTOR
--- new
static void mld_ntt(mld_poly *p) {
#if MLD_VECTOR && 0
